Subject: [PATCH] Patch 0346: Armour Infusion shares Weapon Enchant art, picker
 grids, Alchemist rework

- ArmourInfusionStation.tsx now shares Weapon Enchanting's own infuse.jpg scene/rects instead of its own dedicated art
- New PickerModal layout='grid' option (square icon+name cards) applied to Weapon Enchanting's and Armour Infusion's item/enchant/gem pickers
- New Alchemist art (single-slot, day/night pair); consumable crafting collapsed to one step via a recipe table with live red/green material affordability (materialBadges helper); charm category untouched
- guild-idler-status.md updated with the patch 0346 entry
